## 🧪 Testing Standards

### Testing Pyramid
- Unit tests for utilities and pure functions
- Integration tests for API routes
- E2E tests for critical user flows
- Visual regression tests for UI components

```typescript
// ✅ GOOD: Test structure
describe('StationCard', () => {
  it('renders station information correctly', () => {
    const station = createMockStation()
    render(<StationCard station={station} />)
    
    expect(screen.getByText(station.name)).toBeInTheDocument()
    expect(screen.getByText(station.line)).toBeInTheDocument()
  })
  
  it('handles favorite toggle interaction', async () => {
    const station = createMockStation()
    const onToggleFavorite = vi.fn()
    
    render(<StationCard station={station} onToggleFavorite={onToggleFavorite} />)
    
    await user.click(screen.getByRole('button', { name: /add to favorites/i }))
    
    expect(onToggleFavorite).toHaveBeenCalledWith(station.id)
  })
})
```

